            "title": "Example: Incrementing",
            "id": 79150,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dentro del bloque de código del <code>for</code> loop, añade <code>~</code> a la variable <code>line</code> usando el operador <code>+=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;*&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += \" /><text value=\"&quot;~&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(line)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"*\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~~\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>+=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: i counter",
            "id": 79145,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es la variable de contador del bucle <code>for</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += i\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(line)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>line</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>in</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Al final de la tercera repetición, ¿qué valores tienen <code>i</code> y <code>line</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += i\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(line)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code> vale <code>2</code> y <code>line</code> vale <code>3</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code> vale <code>3</code> y <code>line</code> vale <code>3</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code> vale <code>2</code> y <code>line</code> vale <code>2</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i</code> vale <code>2</code> y <code>line</code> vale <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 79144,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es el nombre de la variable contador en este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Zero to four:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" repetition \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(repetition)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Zero to four:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>repetition</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Zero to five:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>repetition</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La consola de abajo muestra lo que este código imprime tal como está.</p><p>Ahora supón que la cabecera del bucle fuera <code>for step in range(5):</code> pero la línea de salida siguiera usando <code>repetition</code>. ¿Qué haría Python?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Zero to four:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" repetition \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(repetition)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Zero to four:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Python informa de un error porque <code>repetition</code> ya no es el nombre del contador.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">El bucle sigue mostrando los números del <code>0</code> al <code>4</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">El bucle muestra la palabra <code>step</code> cinco veces.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Python informa de un error porque <code>repetition</code> ya no es el nombre del contador.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
